OL,3,ADutch watchdog tells people not to buy
OL,4,AAI smart glasses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority is not revealing which
OL,7,Fglasses it tested, saying only that
OL,8,Fprices ranged from under bB,100 (#84)
OL,9,Fto over bB,500 and originated from
OL,10,Fdifferent continents.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
