OL,3,AAnthropic raises $81bn in
OL,4,Arecord-breaking stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic, the company behind AI
OL,7,Fchatbot Claude, has raised a record
OL,8,F$81bn (#62bn) in a stock market debut
OL,9,Fthat will make it one of the most
OL,10,Fvaluable companies in the world.
OL,12,FA surge of investor appetite to buy
OL,13,Fshares in the loss-making business
OL,14,Fmeant more stock was sold than
OL,15,Foriginally planned. Anthropic's shares
OL,16,Fhave been priced at $83, up from the
OL,17,Fproposed $70-$78 range.
OL,19,FShares will begin trading later on
OL,20,FThursday in New York, valuing the five
OL,21,Fyear-old firm at around $1.5 trillion.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
