OL,3,AAnthropic raises $81bn in
OL,4,Arecord-breaking stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,7,Fcrucial test for fast-growing AI
OL,8,Fsector. Anthropic is the first purely
OL,9,FAI-focused firm to publicly sell its
OL,10,Fshares.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
