OL,3,AUK joins in GTA 6 frenzy as game
OL,4,Abecomes available worldwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter years of anticipation and delays,
OL,7,Fas well as controversy around worker
OL,8,Frights, Grand Theft Auto 6 has
OL,9,Fcompleted its phased worldwide release
OL,10,Fand is available to gamers everywhere,
OL,11,Fincluding the UK.
OL,13,FThere has been near universal praise
OL,14,Ffrom critics, with review aggregator
OL,15,FMetacritic calculating its average
OL,16,Fscore at 99 out of 100 based on 150
OL,17,Freviews.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
