OL,3,AFlorence Pugh hits out at weight loss
OL,4,Aand cosmetic surgery speculation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlorence Pugh has said she was
OL,7,F"disturbed" to see "thousands of
OL,8,Fpeople" discussing her recent
OL,9,Fappearance at the Governors Awards, and
OL,10,Fdenied speculation about weight-loss
OL,11,Fdrugs and facial surgery.
OL,13,FThe actress wrote on Instagram how
OL,14,F"stressful" it was waking up to people
OL,15,F"talking about you and your body in
OL,16,Fways that you can't even comprehend".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
